<title>USA: TABLE - Atlanta Fed index 7.0 in Feb vs rvsd 13.8.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Atlanta Fed index 7.0 in Feb vs rvsd 13.8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said its index of industry business activity fell to 7.0 in February from a revised 13.8 in January.</p>
<p>					  February	    January</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	     7.0		    13.8</p>
<p>Production Index			7.0		    24.2</p>
<p>Prices Received			 1.0		   - 2.5</p>
<p>Prices Paid			    18.1		    17.2</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		   - 9.5		     8.0</p>
<p>New Orders			     14.9		    23.8</p>
<p>Shipments				14.0		    22.1</p>
<p>Number of Employees		 - 0.6		     2.5</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods   - 2.8		   - 0.1</p>
<p>Materials Inventories	     - 6.7		     4.8</p>
<p>Supplier Delivery Time		1.0		     1.8</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
